        },
        {
          "text": " “ ‘Ato itïng chi yitïn, ilïm ngal cho mwochini Mïkulögh kanisen! Otöninan chi nyo rïntoy kwomöy mana cho wïngote. Otöninan nyinte tïkwïl kogh nyo rel nyo kikikirchï kaynat nyo rel nyo menkïtnye chi anka kïpoto chichini onkït kitöni.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
